aysinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037840/extras/b7cb617646ebdaccdca04aace8f69253.poster.avif?t=1768015573\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037840/extras/b7cb617646ebdaccdca04aace8f69253.webm?t=1768015573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037840/extras/b7cb617646ebdaccdca04aace8f69253.mp4?t=1768015573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where bunnies are the apex herbivores and carrots are the social, cultural, and economic lifeblood of society, two superpowers, the Rabbits\u2019 Republic of Carrotia and the Commonwealth of Coneygarths, have been embroiled for decades in a cold war over the best way to manage the planet\u2019s most economically, culturally, and agriculturally important resource: carrots.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carrot reserves have dwindled following years of natural resources, waste, and shipping disasters; multiple years of poor harvests in key carrot-producing regions have placed additional strains on an already tenuous situation. The stalemate in which these two nations have found themselves has been waiting to erupt - until now.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny Ops follows the military operations of two opposing tactical units in key hot zones shortly after the decades-long Cold Carrot War broke out into armed conflict.</p>","developers":["Pickled Sword"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037840/01771af9f6cd1bfee5ce098fd57c6294195de964/header.jpg?t=1768015573","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4037840/1964769378/640ac573908b7c3b0afa30466e4c5cccea7db62